msgid "Sim-to-Real Strategy 2: Co-Training With Real Data"
msgstr "Sim-to-Real 전략 2: 실제 Data를 활용한 Co-Training"

msgid "Simulated SO-101 and vial rack shown as a wireframe scene."
msgstr "Wireframe scene으로 표현한 simulation의 SO-101과 vial rack입니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "Simulation"

msgid "Physical SO-101 holding a vial above the yellow rack."
msgstr "실제 SO-101이 yellow rack 위에서 vial을 잡고 있습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Real robot"
msgstr "Real robot"

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid "Lecture. No robot or running container required."
msgstr "이론 수업입니다. Robot이나 실행 중인 container는 필요하지 않습니다."

msgid "In this session, you'll learn how simulated and real demonstrations contribute to co-training."
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 demonstration이 Co-Training에 어떻게 기여하는지 배웁니다."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid "By the end of this session, you'll be able to:"
msgstr "이 session을 마치면 다음을 수행할 수 있습니다."

msgid "**Explain** co-training strategies for mixing sim and real data"
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 data를 혼합하는 Co-Training 전략 **설명**"

msgid "What Is Co-Training?"
msgstr "Co-Training이란?"

msgid "Co-training combines data from multiple sources—simulation and real-world—during policy training."
msgstr "Co-Training은 policy 학습 중 simulation과 실제 환경 등 여러 source의 data를 결합하는 방식입니다."

msgid ""
"Review simulation and real demonstrations, check sampling exposure, post-train one policy, and "
"evaluate each domain separately."
msgstr ""
"Simulation과 실제 demonstration을 검토하고 sampling 노출 비율을 확인한 뒤 하나의 policy를 post-train하고 각 domain을 별도로 "
"평가합니다."

msgid ""
"Simulation and real demonstrations contribute complementary examples. The training sampler "
"controls their exposure."
msgstr "두 source는 상호 보완적인 예시를 제공하며, training sampler가 각 source를 얼마나 사용할지 결정합니다."

msgid ""
"The selected course checkpoint combines 10 real demonstrations with 75 simulated teleoperation "
"demonstrations. You'll evaluate it in [Co-Training in Practice](13-cotraining-practice.md)."
msgstr ""
"이 과정의 checkpoint는 실제 demonstration 10개와 simulation teleoperation demonstration 75개를 결합합니다. [Co-"
"Training in Practice](13-cotraining-practice.md)에서 평가합니다."

msgid "You'll have a chance to experience policies trained with various mixes of data."
msgstr "다양한 data 조합으로 학습한 policy를 경험할 수 있습니다."

msgid "Physical demonstration"
msgstr "실제 Demonstration"

msgid "Physical demonstration of the task with teleoperation."
msgstr "Teleoperation으로 수행한 실제 task demonstration입니다."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"View a dataset of real-only demonstrations using the Hugging Face Dataset Visualizer "
"[here](https://huggingface.co/spaces/lerobot/visualize_dataset?path=%2Fsreetz-"
"nv%2Fso101_teleop_vials_rack_left_real_50%2Fepisode_0)."
msgstr ""
"Hugging Face Dataset Visualizer에서 real-only demonstration dataset을 "
"[확인하세요](https://huggingface.co/spaces/lerobot/visualize_dataset?path=%2Fsreetz-"
"nv%2Fso101_teleop_vials_rack_left_real_50%2Fepisode_0)."

msgid "The Data Challenge"
msgstr "Data 확보의 과제"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Data Source"
msgstr "Data Source"

msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "수량"

msgid "Quality"
msgstr "품질"

msgid "Reality Match"
msgstr "실제 환경과의 일치"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Simulation**"
msgstr "**Simulation**"

msgid "Abundant"
msgstr "풍부함"

msgid "Consistent"
msgstr "일관됨"

msgid "Approximate"
msgstr "근사"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Real teleop**"
msgstr "**Real teleop**"

msgid "Limited"
msgstr "제한적"

msgid "Variable"
msgstr "가변적"

msgid "Exact"
msgstr "정확함"

msgid "Neither source alone is ideal:"
msgstr "어느 source도 단독으로는 이상적이지 않습니다."

msgid "**Sim-only**: Abundant but doesn't match real-world distribution"
msgstr "**Sim-only**: 풍부하지만 실제 distribution과 다릅니다."

msgid "**Real-only**: Matches reality but quantity is limited"
msgstr "**Real-only**: 실제와 같지만 수량이 제한됩니다."

msgid "**Co-training** leverages both."
msgstr "**Co-Training**은 두 source를 함께 활용합니다."

msgid ""
"There isn't one co-training recipe that works for every task. The useful sim/real mix depends on "
"data quality, coverage, and how closely simulation matches your setup. Test on your robot, then "
"adjust the mix and collect examples around its failures."
msgstr ""
"모든 task에 맞는 하나의 recipe는 없습니다. 유용한 sim/real 조합은 data 품질, coverage, simulation과 실제 setup의 일치 정도에 달려"
" 있습니다. 본인의 robot에서 시험하고 실패 양상에 맞춰 비율과 수집 예시를 조정하세요."
